  "name": "Mission 1: Trench Line",
  "description": "A dug-in OPFOR fireteam holds a short trench line at the edge of the woods, parapets facing south over an open field. A stone wall crosses the field 350 m out. On the east side a sunken farm track runs north behind a hedgerow; the west is open ground and a pond.",
